     "type": "Closures",
     "layerName": "Closures",
     "roadwayName": "Lox Rd",
     "description": "Scheduled Road Work on Lox Rd Both Directions from SR-7 Southbound to Parkside Dr. All lanes closed.<div class='cellSpacer'><i><b>Comments:</b></i> The Florida Department of Transportation has shared that Lox Road is scheduled to close from Parkside Drive to U.S. 441 in January 12, 2026, for roundabout construction. This will be a full closure, and resident access will be maintained. As part of the Loxahatchee Road Improvements Project, crews will begin with phased roadway improvements on Loxahatchee Road between Parkside Drive and U.S. 441/S.R. 7, including the construction of the roundabout at Parkside Drive, starting Jan. 12, 2026. To ensure community and public safety, Loxahatchee Road between Parkside Drive and U.S. 441/S.R. 7 will be closed and traffic will be detoured through Fall of 2026. Business and residential access (Local Access) will be maintained at all times throughout construction. To ensure overall safety, FDOT urges motorists to use precaution as they traverse through the area.</div>",
     "sourceId": "7699",
     "source": "ERS",
     "comment": "The Florida Department of Transportation has shared that Lox Road is scheduled to close from Parkside Drive to U.S. 441 in January 12, 2026, for roundabout construction. This will be a full closure, and resident access will be maintained. As part of the Loxahatchee Road Improvements Project, crews will begin with phased roadway improvements on Loxahatchee Road between Parkside Drive and U.S. 441/S.R. 7, including the construction of the roundabout at Parkside Drive, starting Jan. 12, 2026. To ensure community and public safety, Loxahatchee Road between Parkside Drive and U.S. 441/S.R. 7 will be closed and traffic will be detoured through Fall of 2026. Business and residential access (Local Access) will be maintained at all times throughout construction. To ensure overall safety, FDOT urges motorists to use precaution as they traverse through the area.",
     "eventSubType": "ScheduledRoadWork",
     "startDate": "1/12/26, 7:23 AM",
